Provenance notice: most prompts (batches 000-021 and 030) are outputs of Anthropic
Claude models generated via the Anthropic API. Use of those outputs must
comply with Anthropic's terms and usage policies (https://www.anthropic.com/legal),
including restrictions on using outputs to train competing models. Batches
022-029 were generated with Qwen 3.8 27B (open weights, Apache 2.0) and batches 032-033
with DeepSeek V4 Pro (open weights, MIT) via OpenRouter. The
generating model for every individual prompt is recorded in its .meta.yaml
sidecar. Responses under responses/ are outputs of open-weights models whose
licenses (Apache 2.0, MIT) place no restrictions on the use of outputs; the
model is named in every record and in each run's run.yaml. A response record
also contains the prompt it answers, so records answering Claude-written
prompts carry the notice above with them. In addition, a small number of prompts across all batches were
emended during curation by a Claude model, so an emended prompt may contain
Claude-written text regardless of which model its sidecar names. Prompts may include brief quotations from published works and
translations, reproduced for purposes of commentary and analysis; such
quotations remain the property of their respective rights holders.
